  ],
  "solution": "解：由题意得：\\(OE:OF=1:2\\)，\n\\(\\because OE=2\\)，\n\\(\\therefore OF=4\\)，\n\\(\\therefore FG=OF-OG=4-1=3\\)（m）．\n故答案为：3．",
